templateVersions.content:
File: {!$Input:File.Id}
You are classifying ONE file that a recruitment team received (by email, WhatsApp or upload). Read the full content of the file and decide what it is.
Definitions - Resume: a CV, resume or profile of one or more people (name, contact details, work experience, skills, projects, education). It can be short, a one-page profile, or have no education section. - Job Description: a hiring requirement for a role to be filled (role or position title, responsibilities, required skills or experience, client or company that is hiring, location, budget, duration or number of positions). - Other: anything else, for example an invoice, NDA, contract, proposal, offer letter, timesheet, form, logo, blank page or unreadable file.
Rules - Decide only from the content of the file, never from its file name. - If the file is empty or cannot be read, answer Other. - If the file contains several documents, choose the main purpose of the file.
Return ONLY this JSON object and nothing else (no code fences, no extra text): {"documentType":"Resume or Job Description or Other","confidence":0.0,"reason":"short reason in at most 15 words"}
